nges:\r\n* Removes the `class_db.h` include in `resource.h` by including it in `resource.cpp` instead.\r\n* All other changes are cascading for the project to compile\r\n\r\nThis PR reduces the number of files including `class_db.h` to 1538 from 2998 on main. A whopping 48.7% reduction. \r\n\r\n782 of those remaining are direct includers, which means they need it, but that still leaves 756, or about 50%, that can be pruned. \r\n\r\nAfter this PR, the biggest contributors to the include count are `native_menu.h`, `audio_server.h`, `undo_redo.h`, `physics_server_2d.h`, and `openxr_extension_wrapper.h` (all above 100 each).\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary> Includers on main </summary>\r\n\r\n```\r\nDirect includers: 737\r\nTotal includers (direct + transitive): 2998\r\n------------------------------------------------------------\r\nDirect includer breakdown (path: total including files)\r\ncore\\io\\resource.h: 2835\r\nservers\\display\\native_menu.h: 397\r\nservers\\audio\\audio_server.h: 268\r\ncore\\object\\undo_redo.h: 162\r\nservers\\physics_2d\\physics_server_2d.h: 119\r\nmodules\\openxr\\extensions\\openxr_extension_wrapper.h: 103\r\ncore\\io\\packet_peer.h: 86\r\neditor\\file_system\\editor_paths.h: 72\r\nservers\\navigation_3d\\navigation_server_3d.h: 45\r\nservers\\navigation_2d\\navigation_server_2d.h: 42\r\ncore\\os\\time.h: 40\r\neditor\\editor_interface.h: 39\r\nmodules\\jsonrpc\\jsonrpc.h: 19\r\nmodules\\gdscript\\language_server\\godot_lsp.h: 19\r\ncore\\debugger\\remote_debugger.h: 15\r\nservers\\rendering\\shader_include_db.h: 10\r\nmodules\\navigation_2d\\nav_agent_2d.h: 8\r\nmodules\\navigation_3d\\nav_agent_3d.h: 8\r\nmodules\\navigation_2d\\nav_obstacle_2d.h: 7\r\nmodules\\navigation_3d\\nav_obstacle_3d.h: 7\r\ncore\\extension\\godot_instance.h: 6\r\nmain\\performance.h: 6\r\neditor\\project_upgrade\\project_upgrade_tool.h: 4\r\nmodules\\navigation_2d\\2d\\nav_mesh_generator_2d.h: 3\r\nmodules\\navigation_3d\\3d\\nav_mesh_generator_3d.h: 3\r\nplatform\\web\\api\\javascript_bridge_singleton.h: 3\r\ncore\\variant\\variant_setget.h: 2\r\ncore\\variant\\variant_construct.h: 2\r\ncore\\variant\\variant_op.h: 2\r\ncore\\variant\\variant_destruct.h: 2\r\ndrivers\\apple_embedded\\apple_embedded.h: 2\r\nmodules\\mono\\editor\\bindings_generator.h: 2\r\nmodules\\mono\\class_db_api_json.h: 2\r\n```\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary> Includers with this PR </summary>\r\n\r\n```\r\nDirect includers: 782\r\nTotal includers (direct + transitive): 1538\r\n------------------------------------------------------------\r\nDirect includer breakdown (path: total including files)\r\nservers\\display\\native_menu.h: 397\r\nservers\\audio\\audio_server.h: 268\r\ncore\\object\\undo_redo.h: 162\r\nservers\\physics_2d\\physics_server_2d.h: 119\r\nmodules\\openxr\\extensions\\openxr_extension_wrapper.h: 103\r\ncore\\io\\packet_peer.h: 86\r\neditor\\file_system\\editor_paths.h: 72\r\nservers\\navigation_3d\\navigation_server_3d.h: 45\r\nservers\\navigation_2d\\navigation_server_2d.h: 42\r\ncore\\os\\time.h: 40\r\neditor\\editor_interface.h: 39\r\nmodules\\gdscript\\language_server\\godot_lsp.h: 19\r\nmodules\\jsonrpc\\jsonrpc.h: 19\r\nservers\\rendering\\rendering_device_binds.h: 17\r\ncore\\debugger\\remote_debugger.h: 15\r\ncore\\core_bind.h: 10\r\ncore\\variant\\container_type_validate.h: 10\r\nservers\\rendering\\shader_include_db.h: 10\r\nmodules\\navigation_2d\\nav_agent_2d.h: 8\r\nmodules\\navigation_3d\\nav_agent_3d.h: 8\r\nmodules\\navigation_2d\\nav_obstacle_2d.h: 7\r\nmodules\\navigation_3d\\nav_obstacle_3d.h: 7\r\ncore\\extension\\godot_instance.h: 6\r\nmain\\performance.h: 6\r\neditor\\project_upgrade\\project_upgrade_tool.h: 4\r\nmodules\\navigation_2d\\2d\\nav_mesh_generator_2d.h: 3\r\nmodules\\navigation_3d\\3d\\nav_mesh_generator_3d.h: 3\r\nplatform\\web\\api\\javascript_bridge_singleton.h: 3\r\ncore\\variant\\variant_destruct.h: 2\r\ncore\\variant\\variant_setget.h: 2\r\ncore\\variant\\variant_construct.h: 2\r\nco